              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 6:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima yaatwara omutabani ow'omujigaijo, owaabaire naaza kumuhungurira kuza aha ngoma, yaamutambira aha mutwe gw'orugo rw'amabaare kuba ekitambo ekyokize. Kyareetera abantu okugirira Abaisraeli ekiniga kingi; baamurugaho, baagaruka omu nsi yaabo.",
          "type": "text",
